{"seq":21,"slug":"change-management","title":"变革管理","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"变革管理-简介\">变革管理 简介</h1><p>变革管理是帮助组织和个体从当前状态平稳过渡到期望状态的系统性方法。在技术行业中，变革无处不在——技术栈迁移、敏捷转型、组织架构调整、流程优化、文化变革。然而，大量变革项目的失败并非源于技术方案不够好，而是因为忽视了变革中最关键的因素：人。理解变革管理，就是理解如何在推动组织进步的同时，妥善处理人的恐惧、抵触和不确定感。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向需要推动或参与组织变革的技术管理者和工程师。无论你是正在主导技术架构迁移的架构师、推动团队敏捷转型的 Scrum Master、负责组织架构调整的工程总监，还是在变革浪潮中寻找自身定位的一线开发者，这里都将为你提供从理论模型到实操方法的完整知识体系。</p>\n<p>全书共分四个章节，覆盖变革管理的核心领域：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>变革管理基础</strong>从变革管理的定义与价值出发，深入经典变革模型、变革准备度评估，以及变革阻力的识别与应对，帮助你建立对变革管理的系统性认知。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>变革领导力</strong>聚焦变革领导者的角色定位、变革联盟的建立、变革沟通策略，以及变革中的情绪领导力，帮助你掌握引领变革所需的核心领导能力。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>变革实施方法</strong>围绕变革规划与路线图、试点与推广策略、变革度量与反馈，以及变革固化与持续改进展开，提供从方案设计到落地执行的方法论。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>变革中的人员管理</strong>深入个体变革曲线、团队动态与变革适应、培训赋能与能力建设，以及变革型组织文化的塑造，确保你能够在变革过程中有效管理人的维度。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序学习，前两章建立理论和领导力基础，后两章聚焦实施和人员管理。如果你正处于具体变革项目中，可以优先阅读第三章获取实操指导。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"change-fundamentals","title":"变革管理基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-change-management","title":"什么是变革管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-fundamentals/what-is-change-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"change-models","title":"经典变革模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-fundamentals/change-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"change-readiness","title":"变革准备度评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-fundamentals/change-readiness"},{"seq":4,"slug":"change-resistance","title":"变革阻力与应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-fundamentals/change-resistance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"change-leadership","title":"变革领导力","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-leadership","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"change-leader-role","title":"变革领导者角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-leadership/change-leader-role"},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-change-coalition","title":"建立变革联盟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-leadership/building-change-coalition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"change-communication","title":"变革沟通策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-leadership/change-communication"},{"seq":4,"slug":"emotional-leadership","title":"变革中的情绪领导力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-leadership/emotional-leadership"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"change-implementation","title":"变革实施方法","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"change-planning","title":"变革规划与路线图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-implementation/change-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pilot-and-rollout","title":"试点与推广策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-implementation/pilot-and-rollout"},{"seq":3,"slug":"change-metrics","title":"变革度量与反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-implementation/change-metrics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sustaining-change","title":"变革固化与持续改进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/change-implementation/sustaining-change"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"people-in-change","title":"变革中的人员管理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/people-in-change","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"individual-change-curve","title":"个体变革曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/people-in-change/individual-change-curve"},{"seq":2,"slug":"team-dynamics-in-change","title":"团队动态与变革适应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/people-in-change/team-dynamics-in-change"},{"seq":3,"slug":"training-and-enablement","title":"培训赋能与能力建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/people-in-change/training-and-enablement"},{"seq":4,"slug":"change-culture","title":"变革型组织文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/change-management/people-in-change/change-culture"}]}]}